# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file").
# The map menu's Unit list in the Prologue (port-plan/pending/unitlist.md,
# proposed DIVERGENCES.md D-39): the Prologue up to its first free player phase
# (ticks 0-1995: the start of route_ch0_prologue.keys; the cursor is at (4,5)),
# then the Unit list opened, scrolled through both units and all six pages,
# Eirika's and Seth's stat screens from it, and back to the map.
# Opening the list runs CanUnitSupportNow for each support partner; a partner
# not in the army (GetUnitSupporterUnit NULL) reaches GetUnitSupporterCount(NULL).
# 3000 ticks: make -f port/test/unitlist.mk (port/test/unitlist.mk).
#
#   1996  Down: the cursor to (4,6), an empty tile
#   2012  A: the map menu (A on an empty tile)
#   2044  A: Unit, the menu's first item: the Unit list opens
#   2120  Down: Seth
#   2140  Up: Eirika
#   2160  Right: page 2
#   2200  Right: page 3
#   2240  Right: page 4
#   2280  Right: page 5 (weapon ranks)
#   2320  Right: page 6 (supports)
#   2360  Down: Seth (supports page)
#   2380  Up: Eirika
#   2400  Left: page 5
#   2440  Left: page 4
#   2480  Left: page 3
#   2520  Left: page 2
#   2560  Left: page 1
#   2600  R: Eirika's stat screen
#   2660  Right: stat screen page 2
#   2700  Right: stat screen page 3 (weapon ranks, supports)
#   2740  Down: Seth's stat screen
#   2780  Up: Eirika's stat screen
#   2820  B: back to the Unit list (UnitList_ResetFromStatScreen)
#   2900  B: the Unit list closes, back to the map
# Ticks after the last entry have mask 000.
#
# --- route_ch0_prologue.keys, ticks 0-1995 ---
